      "title": "Observation paths",
      "items": [
        "task_context publishes job and stage frames to run:{run_id}:events (redsim/workers/events.py)",
        "/v1/runs/{run_id}/events relays them (redsim/api/ws.py), SWR polling of /v1/runs/{id} is the fallback, Postgres is the source of truth"
